<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Thermo Cardiosystems a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Thermo Cardiosystems a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Bros initiated coverage of Thermo Cardiosystems Inc with a buy recommendation, according to a Lehman source and later confirmed by a research note issued by the firm.</p>
<p>-- 12-month price target is $45 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares climbed 1-3/8 to 27-7/8 in early American Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
